  "description": "Experience unmatched protection and style with our custom-fit floor mats for the 2022-2026 Ford Maverick Hybrid. Crafted from durable, eco-friendly TPE material, these mats offer full coverage, ensuring your car’s interior stays clean in any weather. Designed to complement your vehicle’s aesthetics, they’re easy to clean and built to last. Trust OEDRO’s decade of expertise for quality you can rely on.\nFeatures\nPerfect Fit: Our advanced 3D laser scanning ensures a custom fit that contours perfectly to your 2022-2025 Ford Maverick Hybrid, providing full coverage without interfering with pedals for a safer drive.\nEco-Friendly Material: Made from GRS-certified, recyclable TPE material, these floor mats are not only durable and odorless but also safe for pets and ideal for all-weather protection, keeping your car’s interior in top condition.\nStylish & Functional: Designed to match the Ford Maverick’s original aesthetics, these floor liners blend seamlessly with your interior while effectively trapping dirt and stains.\nComprehensive Protection: Engineered for all seasons, these floor mats feature edge-to-edge coverage that contains mud, snow, sand, and spills. Cleaning is a breeze—just remove, shake, and hose them down.\nTrusted Expertise: With over 10 years of experience in creating auto floor mats, OEDRO offers reliable products for more than 300 vehicle models, supported by our dedicated US-based customer service teams.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Ford Maverick Hybrid Crew Cab.",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
  ],
